Need a dedicated IP address – but only have a small budget to host your website?
Take a look at what they offer and what you can expect if you select IX to host your site.
It’s always good to start with an overview of the business itself. Often this can tell you whether or not the hosting company has the necessary experience, knowledge and stability to provide the best service for your needs.
The company is proud to say that their reps are trained to provide a “unique and personalized customer support experience.” To that end, each customer is assigned a personal rep when they sign up for IXWebHosting services. That’s a very nice touch.
If you dig a little deeper, you'll see that IXWebHosting comes with several unique features that other web hosts do not offer:
Two, they give you a seven-day period during which your account is free. Of course, you do have to provide a credit card number to get your account started, but it won’t be charged until the eighth day and you can cancel any time before then.
In April 2014, I was invited to try out IX's hosting service for free and I have been tracking IXWebHosting since then. There are both good and bad experience during my stay at IXWebHosting.
Generous dedicated IP offers – Dedicated IP is a big advantage for many!
English-speaking customer service reps located onsite – Great feature especially for US customers.
Honest business practice – As mentioned, I bought an account in 2012 and cancelled within the free trial period. IXWebHosting refunded my money the next day with no question asked.
The question to ask: how reliable is the website hosting company you are considering?
I took a look online and found that three sites hosted by IX, which had been monitored for the past seven years, didn’t quite enjoy that 99.9 percent uptime. In fact, the overall percentage of uptime was 99.839% (but 100 percent for the past seven days when I checked).
As far as security goes, IXWebHosting uses network software that performs constant monitoring, malware discovery and recovery services. A nice feature of the malware service is that if infected files are found in your account, the malicious code is automatically filtered out and the files are corrected.
In short, IXWebHosting is a very reasonable priced hosting service that comes with exceptional customer service, solid hosting servers, and comprehensive hosting features – not to mention that the number of free dedicated IP in Unlimited Pro (which is a huge bargain).
So here's my verdict –If a dedicated IP address is important to you, you have a limited budget, and you are comfortable with website design/development, then IXWebHosting would be a fine choice. On the other hand, if you are a newbie who just got started then no, I don't think IXWebHosting is a good choice.
