Simply enter a hashtag in Instagram’s search field and the platform will show you how many posts exist for that hashtag/keyword. Pick hashtags with no less than 1,000 posts, but also not more than 10K, and make sure you know what people are posting under that, so that your posts can also fit in.
On Facebook and LinkedIn you can “call” both profiles and company pages in comments, updates and threads, but not in Pulse posts (which you can work around with a comment on your Pulse post where you mention the sources you quoted in the piece).
