11. Interview People from Forums and Blog Comments
This is not exactly like #9, because here you are not featuring your readers, but people who are not yet in your community but are still your audience. The moment you invite them to get interviewed and your invitation receives a ‘yes' response, they will create a connection with you and your blog.
