Ebooks may be old news, but they’re still a popular freebie for a reason: they can provide great value to your readers, and can also be very quick and easy for you to produce.
One easy way to create an ebook to offer as a freebie is by compiling a collection of related blog posts from your archives. There are plenty of apps you can use to create ebooks automatically, including PressBooks and Designrr.
