But before dashing in and buying up domain names like crazy there are a couple of things you need to know about the domain flipping business.
These are factors you need to consider:
Even worse are those who don’t go into the business prepared and end up with a bunch of albatross domain names. These are domain names that you can’t even pay someone to take off your hands.
By adhering to basic guidelines such as those I listed above and through some of your own research, you’ll be able to pick names that offer you a higher chance of flipping them more easily. Remember, a net profit of $100 is still a profit, you must start somewhere.
