Don't Mess with Natural Order
In Jurassic World, the scientist in charge of creating the dinosaurs is pushed to create bigger and better dinos. Of course, there's a lot more to the plot than that, but I don't want to spoil it if you haven't yet seen the movie.
What you can learn from the movie is that there is a natural order to things. For example, if you go to other blogger's sites and start posting that people should come visit your site, you are not going to get a very positive reception.
