Web hosting is a competitive industry – hosting companies are doing all they can to win new customers. Many hosting companies, including some great ones that I recommend, provide free website migration service to new customers.
Here's what you need to do if you are going with this option:
Good hosting companies with free site migration:
GreenGeeks– Eco-friendly web host, huge improvement in recent hosting performance.
