Read on below to see how to determine which face shape you have, and what glasses will look perfect on you. Which Glasses Shapes Suit Oval Faces?
A face with an oval shape features higher and slightly wider cheekbones that is slightly narrower towards the forehead. This long, rounded face shape allows you to pull off almost any style — especially oversized and wide frames.
If you have a square-shaped face, many great pairs of eyeglasses can flatter your features. When it comes to proportion, square faces are widest along the jaw and forehead.
